# Dual P&L (ADR 0002)

UI shows **rupees** (qty × price). `targetPnL` / max-profit / max-loss jobs fire on **points** (per-unit).

Do **not** change strategy points in `lib/targetPnL.ts` to rupee-weighted P&L. Multi-lot rupee P&L scales with size; point targets do **not**, by design.

See `docs/adr/0002-dual-pnl-metrics.md`.
